F	C	0	\x0aExit\x20status\x20is\x200\x20if\x20all\x20input\x20numbers\x20were\x20successfully\x20converted.\x0aBy\x20default,\x20%s\x20will\x20stop\x20at\x20the\x20first\x20conversion\x20error\x20with\x20exit\x20status\x202.\x0aWith\x20--invalid='fail'\x20a\x20warning\x20is\x20printed\x20for\x20each\x20conversion\x20error\x0aand\x20the\x20exit\x20status\x20is\x202.\x20\x20With\x20--invalid='warn'\x20each\x20conversion\x20error\x20is\x0adiagnosed,\x20but\x20the\x20exit\x20status\x20is\x200.\x20\x20With\x20--invalid='ignore'\x20conversion\x0aerrors\x20are\x20not\x20diagnosed\x20and\x20the\x20exit\x20status\x20is\x200.\x0a	s:numfmt	@glibc-coreutils,glibc-sysregex-coreutils
